This agreement outlines the terms and conditions for participating in the Spatial Collective Digitization Training Program.

## Terms
1. Participants agree to attend all training sessions
2. Participants will maintain confidentiality of project data
3. Participants commit to quality standards in mapping

## Duration
This agreement is valid for the duration of the training program.', NULL, true, NULL, '2025-12-05T09:58:18.574Z', '2025-12-08T15:11:28.856Z');

This agreement covers participation in mobile data collection training.

## Terms
1. Proper use of mobile devices and applications
2. Data quality and accuracy standards
